Cell["\<\
Encodes the interaction-net annihilation law: two matching nodes meeting \
head-on disappear, joining their remaining legs pairwise.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"97b6ab3d-fad7-4020-ba1a-cb26c6c96e6a"],

Cell["The following options can be given:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a9c34530-73de-4234-8d04-817af9457c7a"],

